  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you sit in a station while in full body tracking and the station moves, your avatar's hip will get dragged forward in the direction that the station is moving, and the rest of the bones will eventually get dragged along with it. This starts becoming a detriment to being able to control vehicles even at the speeds that cars move. This has been an issue for a long time.\nhttps://streamable.com/vsr6gj\nIn the attached video you can see my body become completely detached from my camera, at various points I can see my own head.",
